body=intro('Teaching & resources','Bring the text into the room.','Passage-centered studies and guides for personal reading, adult classes, and small groups.')+'''<section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A place to begin</p><h2>Walking in the light</h2><p class="lede">A discussion guide for 1 John 1:5–2:2, with observation questions, a 40-minute session outline, and space to reflect.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/resources/walking-in-the-light/">Open the guide</a><a class="text-link" href="/downloads/walking-in-the-light.html" download>Download printable HTML</a></div></section><section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">From Spiraling Light</p><h2>Study guide archive</h2><div class="resource-list">'''
